  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "This is the first standalone release of the CoreML execution provider for YoloDotNet following the introduction of the new modular architecture.\n\nThe CoreML execution provider enables hardware-accelerated inference on macOS using Apple’s native Core ML framework through ONNX Runtime. No additional system-level dependencies, drivers, or runtimes are required.\n\nThis provider is intended for macOS applications that benefit from native machine learning acceleration and low-power inference. It is fully compatible with the YoloDotNet core library and follows the new execution-provider-agnostic design introduced in YoloDotNet v4.0.",
